        "payload": "tree 147f754255480d1d322adb238963926ccf937f31\nparent f72537037d3350e2974efd760eaa7b04f820880c\nauthor cyb3ralbert <cyberalbert@protonmail.ch> 1787131342 +0300\ncommitter cyb3ralbert <cyberalbert@protonmail.ch> 1787144863 +0300\n\ntest: add coverage for bitcoin wrapper argument handling\n\nThe bitcoin wrapper's own argument handling is not exercised by any test.\ntool_bitcoin.py only checks which binary gets exec'd, so the paths that\nreturn without exec - version, help, no command, unknown command and\nunknown option - are never run.\n\nAdd checks for those five cases.\n",
